<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine 1996 petroleum consumption up 5.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Philippine 1996 petroleum consumption up 5.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine petroleum products consumption rose by 5.8 percent to 131.6 million barrels in 1996 from 124.344 million barrels in 1995, the Department of Energy reported on Monday.</p>
</text>
